    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42905" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσκάλισις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, prob.<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>packing in a wooden crate</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾶλον</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				4.1485.85
			</span></i> (Epid.); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρκάλισις</span> and
			perh. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακάλισις,</span> unless all three
			words belong to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλινδέω</span> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλίω</span>).</div>
